🚨 Fully funded PhD position in AI weather prediction and climate-change attribution of extreme events

We are looking for a highly motivated PhD student to join the Physics of Climate and Climate Change group at 
@IGeociencias in Madrid.

@getsea.bsky.social is accepting applications from early-stage PhD students for four two-year mentoring clusters in Southeast Asian studies.

Applications are due October 1, 2026.

